<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand bill auction results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand bill auction results.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced the following results for its bills issue on Friday:</p>
<p>    MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD  RANGE</p>
<p>		  (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    28 days    3,635	  2,000	  12.73    12.49-13.00</p>
<p>    91 days    2,225	  1,000	  11.36    10.99-11.74</p>
<p>Results for bond issued by Financial Institutions</p>
<p>Development Fund:</p>
<p>    91 days    4,565	  2,000	  11.40    10.99-12.05</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642 ($1 = 25.75 baht)</p>
</text>
